# Nonconclusions

This campaign does **not** establish any of the following:

- a physical hidden-memory dimension;
- a unique microscopic HMM or environment;
- a minimax sample complexity against every rank<=3 process;
- a universal sparse-query complexity theorem for arbitrary rank-H HMMs;
- a real detector calibration or apparatus tolerance;
- that every physically admissible detector model lies in the declared inverse-map polytope;
- a sourced heat, unitary or wave channel;
- a Born rule or physical interpretation of the declared wave squared response;
- an absolute physical clock or time unit;
- continuum spacetime, quantum mechanics, gravity, Standard Model or ToE closure.
